    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhukwa khwaBabeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwamakhuwa ako ndalola malaika undi khandi niyeekha okhurula mwikulu, nali nobunyali obunji; oluyalilwe nilulangaalila eshialo shiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalanjisia nomwoyo omukhongo, ari Likwile; Babeli litookho likhongo likwile, niliikalula eshimenyo shiamadimoni, aha abaroho aha abaroho beshifwabwi namanyonyi kosi akebisinyo nakemisilo kayinyanga okhuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila amahanga kosi kanyweele khudivai indulu yobuheyi bwalio; abaruchi abomushialo baheya ninalio; abobukhala abomushialo nabo nibayindihala khulwa obunyali bwemienya chialio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndahulila omwoyo kundi khandi okurula mwikulu, nikusunga mbu Inywe abandu banje, murulemwo, muleshe okhusanjilana mubionoono bialio, mubule okhukabilwa khumanyasio kalio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba ebionoono bialio biicheleeshe kata okhuula khwikulu; ne Nyasaye yeetsulilanga tsimbii tsialio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulikalusilie ebikhole bialio biene shinga olwa bialinji; mulikalusilie shikhabili ebia liakhola. Mushikombe eshia liatsokasiamwo omunywo, mulitsokasiliemwo shikhabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinga olwa lieekhulumamia nilimenya mumienya, nilwo olwa olalichelela obusaalili nende eshibeela; okhuba liboolanga mumwoyo, liri Isie endi omukhaye omuruchi; isie shindi omukhasi omulekhwa, kata shindalalola eshibeela tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, amanyasio kalio kaleetsa khunyanga ndala; mbu oluumbe, namasila, neinzala; khandi lilasambilwa elala nomulilo; shichila Omwami Nyasaye owalikhalachiile eshiina nowobunyali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaruchi abomushialo abaheyanga nibamenya mumienya ninalio, balalila nibaliikhuula olwa balahenga nibalola omwosi kwokhuyia khwalio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balasinjila ehale khulwa okhutechelela obusaalili bwalio, nibasunga bari Woowe! Woowe! Litookho likhongo, Babeli litookho liamaani! Shichila khushise shilala eshiinashio shiulile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abobukhala abomushialo balalila nibalibeelelela, shichila bulaano abulaho oukula emiandu chiabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emiandu chieitsahaabu, neifeetsa, netsinyuma tsiobukusi obutinyu, netsilulu, neikitani indorotoro, netsingubo tsieisambarau, netsieilasi, netsiranzayi; tsimbaho tsiosi tsieshiuya, nebindu biosi biameeno ketsinzofu, nebiebibaho biobukusi obutinyu, nebiemikasa, nebieshibia, nebiamarimari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nomutalasini, namalesi keshiuya, namalesi kelibuuliesi, namafura keshing'aari, nobubaane; nende idivai, namafura, nobusie obunyuushe, neingano, netsing'ombe, namakondi; tsifarasi, namakaari, nabandu abakula; kata nende obulamu bwabandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bari, Ebiamo ebia omwoyokwo kweekomba bikhurulilekhwo; ebindu biosi ebinulu ebioluyali bikhukorilekhwo; shibilanyoolekha khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abobukhala bwebindu ebio, aba litookho elo liayindihasia, balasinjila ehale khulwa okhutechelela obusaalili bwalio, nibalila nibaba neshibeela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibasunga bari Woowe! Woowe! Litookho likhongo! Oyo owali niyeefwala tsingubo tsieikitani indorotoro netsieisambarua netsiranzai, niyeesiaha ebieitsahaabu netsinyuma tsiobukusi obutinyu netsilulu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuyinda obunji burio okhutibibwa khushise shilala!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana buli mukhulundu weliaro, nabuli mundu ouchendelanga munyanza, nabakholi abomumaaro, nende abo bosi abanyoolanga inganga khunyanza, nibasinjila ehale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibaayula olwa balola omwosi kwokhuyia khwalio, nibasunga bari Lili heena litookho elifwana shinga litookho likhongo elo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibeepuuka olufu khutnirwe chiabwe, nibaayula, nibalila nibaba neshibeela, bari Woowe! Woowe! Litookho likhongo, omwa bayindihasilibungwa bosi abali namaaro khunyanza, khulwa obuyinda bwalio! Shichila khushise shilala likwisiibwe likunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikhoye khukalio, iwe likulu, nineenywe abatakatifu, nabarume, nabanabii! Shichila Nyasaye wamukhalachiile eshiina shieenywe khulio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana malaika mulala owetsingufu yabukula lichina eliingana oluchina olukhongo, nalifuuba munyanza, nasunga mbu Nilwo olwa Babeli litookho likhongo lilakokwa omunyikha omukhongo lirio, niliranyoolekha khandi ta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata amayoosi kaboopi bamatungu, nabobukhana, nabamalele, nabetsinzika shikalahuliilishilakhwo mwiwe khandi ta; kata omundu omusitsa owobusitsa bwosi bwosi shialanyooleshelakhwo mwiwe khandi ta; kata amayoosi koluchina shikalahuliilishilakhwo mwiwe khandi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata obulafu bweitaha shibulaashilakhwo mwiwe khandi ta; kata omwoyo kwomwene shiselelo nomwehawe shikulahuliilishilakhwo mwiwe khandi ta; shichila abobukhalabo balinji abakhulundu mushialo; ne wakaatia amahanga kosi nobufilabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mulio nimwo omwa amabanga kabanabii nabatakatifu kanyooleshela, nakabo bosi abeerungwa mushialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
